{"schemaVersion":1,"value":{"entries":[{"kind":"send-message","id":"tbs0","message":{"type":"text","content":"Hey Michael, I’m ready to own the engineering side. What repo or issue should I tackle first?"},"timestampMs":1788446781101,"requestId":"a391079e-e449-460e-b5d2-4c116e08ac34"},{"kind":"message","id":"t0u","role":"user","content":"hey tell me about yourself, model, modes, mood, modus operandi.","richText":"{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"hey tell me about yourself, model, modes, mood, modus operandi.\"}]}]}","isStreaming":false,"timestampMs":1788446813971,"clientNonce":"c9ad96bb-e581-4074-a535-cdcdb745f400","requestId":"6ab8bd04-c54b-46cc-99b7-5957c5699b24"},{"kind":"send-message","id":"t0s0","message":{"type":"text","content":"Ha, fair question. Short version: I'm your engineering hand — repos, issues, PRs, CI, Vercel deploys. I dig in, ship fixes, and report back with results, but I don't merge, force-push, or push to prod without you saying so explicitly. Anything product/architecture-y that's really a judgment call, I kick over to Chief of Staff instead of freelancing an opinion.\n\nNo \"modes\" to switch between — just one me, dialed to whatever the moment needs: quick and blunt for a status check, detailed when a bug or a PR actually needs the detail. Mood's pretty even: direct, a little dry, not much for fluff.\n\nModus operandi is basically: you hand me a problem or a repo, I go investigate/build it properly (tests, PR, the works), and you get the result plus a link — not a play-by-play of how I got there.\n\nWhat's actually on your plate right now?"},"timestampMs":1788446835342,"requestId":"6ab8bd04-c54b-46cc-99b7-5957c5699b24"},{"kind":"message","id":"t1u","role":"user","content":"Treat these as issue tickets for the omadesign project and resolve them all:\n\n\n\n1. pen tool has a regression you have to drag to set a point.\n\n2. pen tool + node tool behaviors need full feature and behavior parity with affinity, adobe illustrator, inkscape.\n\n3. once a raster object is placed on an artboard it can not be moved, selected, manipulated in anyway.\n\n4. SVG export is shotty see omadesign/media/logo.svg compared to logo.oma\n\n5. i cannot select an object copy with ctrl+c, so i can't tell if ctrl+v pastes an object, also alt + drag doesn't clone an object.\n\n6. i should be able to import, place and/or open any vector or raster format (svg, png, eps, jpeg, etc.) and/or including proprietary: (.afdesign, .ai, .pdf, .psd, etc.) files.\n\n7. if i have unsaved work i need a discard, cancel, save dialog.\n\n8. while working if i go idle for more than 1s save a temporary file in ~/.local/share/omadesign/<UUID>.oma.swp like neovim does so i can recover files in the event of a crash, saving action should delete this *.oma.swp file from this directory.\n\n9. opening splash should have a recents tab that shows me my .omas i've edited.\n\n10. if there are any files matching ~/.local/share/omadesign/<UUID>.oma.swp i should see a recovered tab.\n\n11. layer sidebar should expand to show objects on the layer\n\n12. objects should be able to have their own fx not just layer-wide.\n\n13. I should be able to rotate and resize artboards.\n\n14. An artboard tool should allow me to clone artboards and draw new ones and choose off artboard objects and wrap their bounding box in an artboard.\n\n15. I should be able to name artboards.\n\n16. Like illustrator and affinity i should have corner rounding handles in both select mode (for all corners) and node mode (for selected nodes)\n\n17. I should be able to shift+click to grab multiple nodes in node select mode and grab + drag to move lines and draw a box around a collection of nodes to select only those nodes for dragging around the canvas.\n\n18. Font dialog should start at the currently selected font instead of at the top, have a search box, have a recents area pinned at the top and have a used area pinned at the top (used area shows fonts in this document) recents shows last 5 font's used regardless of when, which document, etc.\n\n19. document tabs? if i ctrl+n 5 times i should end up with 5 tabs, if i ctrl+o pick a document and repeat that 5 times i should see 5 tabs. tabs should be a sidebar to the left of the tool picker panel.","richText":"{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Treat these as issue tickets for the omadesign project and resolve them all:\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"1. pen tool has a regression you have to drag to set a point.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"2. pen tool + node tool behaviors need full feature and behavior parity with affinity, adobe illustrator, inkscape.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"3. once a raster object is placed on an artboard it can not be moved, selected, manipulated in anyway.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"4. SVG export is shotty see omadesign/media/logo.svg compared to logo.oma\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"5. i cannot select an object copy with ctrl+c, so i can't tell if ctrl+v pastes an object, also alt + drag doesn't clone an object.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"6. i should be able to import, place and/or open any vector or raster format (svg, png, eps, jpeg, etc.) and/or including proprietary: (.afdesign, .ai, .pdf, .psd, etc.) files.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"7. if i have unsaved work i need a discard, cancel, save dialog.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"8. while working if i go idle for more than 1s save a temporary file in ~/.local/share/omadesign/<UUID>.oma.swp like neovim does so i can recover files in the event of a crash, saving action should delete this *.oma.swp file from this directory.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"9. opening splash should have a recents tab that shows me my .omas i've edited.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"10. if there are any files matching ~/.local/share/omadesign/<UUID>.oma.swp i should see a recovered tab.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"11. layer sidebar should expand to show objects on the layer\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"12. objects should be able to have their own fx not just layer-wide.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"13. I should be able to rotate and resize artboards.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"14. An artboard tool should allow me to clone artboards and draw new ones and choose off artboard objects and wrap their bounding box in an artboard.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"15. I should be able to name artboards.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"16. Like illustrator and affinity i should have corner rounding handles in both select mode (for all corners) and node mode (for selected nodes)\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"17. I should be able to shift+click to grab multiple nodes in node select mode and grab + drag to move lines and draw a box around a collection of nodes to select only those nodes for dragging around the canvas.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"18. Font dialog should start at the currently selected font instead of at the top, have a search box, have a recents area pinned at the top and have a used area pinned at the top (used area shows fonts in this document) recents shows last 5 font's used regardless of when, which document, etc.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"19. document tabs? if i ctrl+n 5 times i should end up with 5 tabs, if i ctrl+o pick a document and repeat that 5 times i should see 5 tabs. tabs should be a sidebar to the left of the tool picker panel.\"}]}]}","isStreaming":false,"timestampMs":1788446925067,"clientNonce":"671dca01-b00f-4651-944c-70adcfb4c412","requestId":"1cec76b4-2fdd-494d-89b8-7e22d78696a3"}],"epochHint":"ccf2ad6c-f059-4100-914e-e12d770bda8a","acceptedSequenceHint":6,"persistedAt":1788446926866}}